<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  THE GATE BLOCK of Главная. 13-start-screen.md 8.2 / 8.3, android-home.md W-2.
  ============================================================================

  What used to be the onboarding CARD - the de-facto sign-in screen for every new
  install, floating on a radial gradient with up to four filled accent surfaces on
  it - is now one caption and one action, occupying the SAME SLOT as the two ledger
  rows and never shown beside them (13 s. 4: #ledger and #gate are mutually
  exclusive).

      [ caption   Body 14/400, centred, wraps to 2 lines ]
         16
      [ primary   the ONE filled accent surface on this screen ]
         12
      [ secondary Tertiary text button, optional ]

  ACCENT BUDGET (00-rules.md 3.6, 13 s. 8.2). Exactly one filled accent surface.
  On a gated screen the connect disc is disabled, so the count is still one; the
  card this replaces carried a filled «Сканировать QR», a tonal capsule «Войти через
  Telegram», an accent ring and an accent glow at the same time.

  NO CARD. A card is an object acted on as a unit; this is the screen's own next
  step, on the screen's own ground. That also retires the 52dp fixed button height,
  the 26dp capsule radius and the synthetic bold the old card carried - every one of
  them now comes from @style/Widget.Departament.Button.*, where a height is a
  MINIMUM and Material's 6dp insets are already zeroed (R2).

  «Войти» is the primary and «Добавить подписку» the secondary. This product sells
  подписки through the site and the bot, so the overwhelmingly common first run is
  a user who has already paid and needs to sign in. QR and clipboard import stay
  one tap away behind the secondary.

  THE SECONDARY IS NOT DECORATION, and it is the reason this block has two slots:
  in the signed-in-with-no-подписка shape it carries «Привязать Telegram», the only
  live entry point to linking Telegram anywhere on Главная. The onboarding card
  that used to hold it was replaced by this block; the action came with it.

  The caption's colour is set by HomeFragment: onSurfaceVariant normally,
  @color/color_destructive_text when the caption IS the failure reason.
-->
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools"
    android:id="@+id/gate"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
    android:layout_marginStart="@dimen/screen_gutter"
    android:layout_marginEnd="@dimen/screen_gutter"
    android:gravity="center_horizontal"
    android:orientation="vertical"
    android:visibility="gone"
    tools:visibility="visible">

    <TextView
        android:id="@+id/tv_gate_caption"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:gravity="center"
        android:maxLines="2"
        android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Body"
        android:textColor="?attr/colorOnSurfaceVariant"
        tools:text="Войдите, чтобы получить серверы departament." />

    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
        android:id="@+id/btn_gate_primary"
        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Button.Primary.Tall"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_16"
        tools:text="Войти" />

    <com.google.android.material.button.MaterialButton
        android:id="@+id/btn_gate_secondary"
        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Button.Tertiary"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_12"
        android:visibility="gone"
        tools:text="Добавить подписку"
        tools:visibility="visible" />
</LinearLayout>
